WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.039
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.130 --> 01:42.940
[Episode 03]

01:43.100 --> 01:44.430
I want to challenge you.

01:49.660 --> 01:50.340
Fine.

01:55.100 --> 01:57.500
I'll wait for you to beg for my forgiveness.

02:03.860 --> 02:06.020
Why didn’t you directly go to Senior Bai Feng

02:06.020 --> 02:07.260
with the evidence?

02:07.300 --> 02:07.900
You can give it to her and...

02:07.900 --> 02:09.630
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

02:13.180 --> 02:14.220
Can you tell me your plan first

02:14.220 --> 02:15.260
in the future?

02:16.140 --> 02:18.660
She is the strongest among these female disciples.

02:18.660 --> 02:20.260
Have you thought it through?

02:20.340 --> 02:20.810
I...

02:25.260 --> 02:25.860
Come down.

02:26.860 --> 02:27.460
Come down.

02:28.900 --> 02:29.500
Fine.

02:37.020 --> 02:38.420
Did I do something wrong?

02:44.020 --> 02:45.079
Come to think of it,

02:46.180 --> 02:47.700
you did nothing wrong.

02:51.300 --> 02:52.100
Thank you.

03:17.180 --> 03:19.300
The Lord is going to use the Moon Platform to contact Immortal Palace

03:19.300 --> 03:20.630
to ask for the King Herb.

03:22.020 --> 03:23.940
The King Herb gathered the spiritual energy of heaven and earth

03:23.940 --> 03:25.870
and the essence of the sun and moon.

03:25.980 --> 03:27.340
It can strengthen your body, prolong your life,

03:27.340 --> 03:28.870
and enhance your vitality.

03:30.740 --> 03:31.780
If we can get it,

03:32.140 --> 03:33.980
it will surely solve my problem.

03:42.530 --> 03:43.660
Wait for me outside.

04:02.860 --> 04:04.020
Marquis Wuyang.

04:04.260 --> 04:05.700
Why are you here

04:05.780 --> 04:07.220
to see me?

04:07.260 --> 04:08.700
I've encountered a bottleneck in cultivation.

04:08.700 --> 04:09.580
May I ask

04:10.260 --> 04:11.980
how can I get the King Herb?

04:12.300 --> 04:13.140
King Herb?

04:14.250 --> 04:17.060
You're still cultivating magic.

04:17.940 --> 04:18.620
Yes.

04:18.860 --> 04:19.899
Back then,

04:20.100 --> 04:22.740
you knew cultivating the magic forcibly

04:23.090 --> 04:24.620
will cost your life,

04:24.620 --> 04:26.420
but you still insisted.

04:26.900 --> 04:28.220
I know

04:28.420 --> 04:30.220
what you did for the Three Realms

04:30.700 --> 04:32.700
and the people.

04:32.970 --> 04:35.260
But this is a serious matter

04:35.540 --> 04:37.420
and there are many hidden dangers.

04:37.420 --> 04:40.260
There's still no successor of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

04:40.260 --> 04:41.370
As for the successor,

04:41.370 --> 04:42.700
I will make the decision

04:43.020 --> 04:44.140
before I die.

04:45.100 --> 04:46.700
I just hope that in the remaining years,

04:46.700 --> 04:48.260
I can use the power of the King Herb

04:48.260 --> 04:50.190
to ensure peace in the human world.

04:51.020 --> 04:52.220
Please enlighten me.

04:52.740 --> 04:53.980
Spirit fire.

04:54.860 --> 04:56.490
Only the destined person

04:56.980 --> 05:00.620
who pass the test and training of the spirit fire

05:00.980 --> 05:03.510
can get the King Herb in the Moon Washing Pond.

05:07.180 --> 05:09.420
Thank you for your enlightening.

05:13.340 --> 05:16.340
No one has passed the test and training of the spirit fire for so many years.

05:16.340 --> 05:17.400
Can it really work?

05:20.820 --> 05:23.340
There are Yin and Yang, but there are no strong or weak.

05:23.340 --> 05:24.650
So Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

05:24.650 --> 05:26.220
recruits both male and female disciples.

05:26.220 --> 05:29.080
Today, all disciples will compete at the same time.

05:29.260 --> 05:31.540
Best disciples will be selected among male and female disciples

05:31.540 --> 05:32.540
and get promoted.

05:34.780 --> 05:36.700
Male and female disciples will take part in the knockout

05:36.700 --> 05:38.159
in two arenas separately.

05:41.140 --> 05:42.200
The battle begins.

05:53.540 --> 05:55.600
You can only use the weapon you chose.

05:56.170 --> 05:58.140
You can't use any magic or spells.

06:03.900 --> 06:05.060
Among these disciples,

06:05.060 --> 06:06.860
there are several that are quite well-trained.

06:06.860 --> 06:08.580
Xi, Lu Li, and Liu Shao

06:08.940 --> 06:11.070
can be regarded as the best among them.

06:15.780 --> 06:16.420
Lu Li.

06:17.020 --> 06:17.370
Yes.

06:18.500 --> 06:20.160
I noticed that you won easily.

06:20.500 --> 06:22.100
You must still have energy.

06:23.220 --> 06:23.940
How about

06:24.140 --> 06:26.500
competing with Senior Du Mingchong?

06:27.740 --> 06:28.620
For the final winner,

06:28.620 --> 06:29.060
I...

06:30.140 --> 06:30.900
I

06:31.980 --> 06:33.770
will grant him a wish.

06:35.590 --> 06:37.610
[Yu Yu Hall]

06:35.650 --> 06:36.820
What are you waiting for?

06:36.820 --> 06:37.620
You may begin.

06:38.420 --> 06:39.140
Yes.

06:44.940 --> 06:46.270
Brother, just beat him.

06:52.580 --> 06:53.140
Liu Shao.

06:59.700 --> 07:00.960
If nothing goes wrong,

07:01.710 --> 07:04.170
even if Liu Shao can defeat other disciples,

07:04.300 --> 07:06.630
she'll have to battle with Xi eventually.

07:08.100 --> 07:09.700
Now the Lord gave me a chance.

07:11.020 --> 07:12.620
If I want to protect Liu Shao,

07:13.540 --> 07:14.220
I must

07:15.610 --> 07:17.000
win this battle.

07:19.060 --> 07:21.100
Show me what you've got.

08:13.260 --> 08:14.810
Not bad.

08:16.740 --> 08:17.420
Wang Jian.

08:19.380 --> 08:19.940
Xu...Xu...

08:19.940 --> 08:20.820
Xue?

08:21.420 --> 08:22.350
Why are you here?

08:22.660 --> 08:23.660
Where is Liu Shao?

08:23.900 --> 08:25.100
She accepted the challenge for me.

08:25.100 --> 08:25.830
I'm worried.

08:26.020 --> 08:27.150
Liu Shao is not here.

08:27.300 --> 08:28.500
Let me take you there.

09:08.540 --> 09:08.900
Liu Shao!

09:08.900 --> 09:09.430
Liu Shao!

09:16.340 --> 09:16.810
Liu Shao.

09:16.810 --> 09:17.340
Liu Shao.

09:17.900 --> 09:18.460
Liu Shao.

09:19.180 --> 09:20.540
Just an eye candy

09:21.180 --> 09:22.580
with neither capability

09:22.660 --> 09:24.020
nor cultivation.

09:24.500 --> 09:26.160
How dare you speak for others?

09:26.860 --> 09:28.770
How dare you dodge

09:29.340 --> 09:30.700
my Silver Snake Whip?

09:32.740 --> 09:33.460
Miss Xi.

09:33.860 --> 09:34.700
It's all my fault.

09:34.700 --> 09:35.420
Don't blame Liu Shao.

09:35.420 --> 09:36.620
It has nothing to do with Liu Shao.

09:36.620 --> 09:37.620
It's all my fault.

09:37.820 --> 09:39.260
You're pleading for her?

09:39.420 --> 09:40.700
How dare you!

09:41.300 --> 09:42.860
The daughter of a lowly cook

09:43.300 --> 09:44.700
is always a lowly person.

09:45.220 --> 09:47.180
You deserve to be stepped on.

09:48.060 --> 09:49.420
You want to change your fate

09:49.420 --> 09:51.240
by entering Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

09:51.240 --> 09:52.380
Since your despicable father

09:52.380 --> 09:54.040
doesn't care about your life,

09:55.140 --> 09:57.270
I may just need to spend a little money.

09:57.300 --> 09:59.430
How dare you team up with this eye candy

09:59.450 --> 10:00.540
to block my way?

10:01.500 --> 10:03.100
You want me to spare Liu Shao?

10:03.380 --> 10:03.980
Fine.

10:04.690 --> 10:06.540
Just break your arms.

10:07.570 --> 10:09.260
Maybe I can spare her.

10:18.700 --> 10:19.540
Why?

10:25.020 --> 10:26.100
Why?

10:29.860 --> 10:30.540
Liu Shao.

10:37.540 --> 10:38.060
No.

10:40.100 --> 10:40.620
Xue.

10:42.180 --> 10:43.580
You don't have to do this.

10:45.890 --> 10:46.940
This

10:47.860 --> 10:49.320
has nothing to do with you.

10:50.500 --> 10:51.430
-Liu Shao. -Xue.

11:07.420 --> 11:09.480
You've never experienced hardships

11:09.980 --> 11:12.040
and never suffered any humiliation.

11:12.500 --> 11:14.230
You don't know about kindness.

11:14.740 --> 11:16.200
You're different from us.

11:16.740 --> 11:18.000
You don't know, do you?

11:18.900 --> 11:20.260
People like you

11:22.620 --> 11:23.900
are the most pathetic.

11:25.900 --> 11:27.500
You want to teach me a lesson?

11:27.690 --> 11:29.020
Who do you think you are?

11:29.780 --> 11:31.310
Then I am determined to take

11:31.740 --> 11:33.100
Xue's arms.

11:39.220 --> 11:41.820
What is the sword intent of Lightning Slash?

11:42.100 --> 11:43.700
I own this three-feet sword.

11:43.740 --> 11:45.330
And I will use it to clear all injustices.

11:45.330 --> 11:47.380
This is the sword intent of Lightning Slash.

11:47.380 --> 11:48.780
For the superior Miss Liu

11:48.900 --> 11:50.540
who spends money casually and

11:50.540 --> 11:52.100
never knows the hardships of human,

11:52.100 --> 11:53.300
it may be

11:53.620 --> 11:54.820
too complicated.

11:59.540 --> 12:01.140
I own this three-feet sword.

12:15.380 --> 12:17.640
And I will use it to clear all injustices.

12:26.530 --> 12:28.100
Your hands have been crippled.

12:28.100 --> 12:28.960
People like you

12:29.780 --> 12:33.110
don't deserve to be a disciple of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

12:34.820 --> 12:35.820
Lightning Slash?

12:36.460 --> 12:36.990
Liu Shao!

12:37.100 --> 12:38.430
-Liu Shao won! -She won!

12:39.380 --> 12:40.580
-Liu Shao! -Liu Shao!

12:41.380 --> 12:42.580
-Liu Shao. -Liu Shao.

12:43.580 --> 12:44.110
Liu Shao.

12:44.620 --> 12:45.550
Senior Bai Feng.

12:45.820 --> 12:46.980
Am I mistaken?

12:47.330 --> 12:48.820
It seems what Liu Shao used just now

12:48.820 --> 12:50.550
is the Lord's Lightning Slash.

13:36.260 --> 13:36.860
Du.

13:41.060 --> 13:41.660
Senior Du.

13:41.820 --> 13:42.750
Is your leg okay?

13:42.770 --> 13:43.420
I just...

13:43.460 --> 13:44.060
Go away.

13:45.220 --> 13:46.350
This doesn't count.

13:46.460 --> 13:47.300
We'll start over.

13:47.300 --> 13:49.580
It is regulated that competitors can not leave the Tai-Chi Platform.

13:49.580 --> 13:50.460
You lost.

13:50.570 --> 13:51.140
Chong,

13:51.660 --> 13:52.860
you are too careless.

13:52.860 --> 13:53.900
This guy has always been cunning.

13:53.900 --> 13:54.900
Let us start over.

13:55.420 --> 13:56.010
Stop!

13:59.260 --> 13:59.780
Chong,

14:00.940 --> 14:02.000
admit your defeat.

14:02.530 --> 14:03.380
But Lu Li,

14:03.980 --> 14:06.020
if your senior had done his best,

14:06.420 --> 14:07.680
you might not have won.

14:07.910 --> 14:08.920
Yes. Yes.

14:09.420 --> 14:11.480
There is no way I can defeat Senior Du.

14:12.260 --> 14:12.860
Senior Du.

14:13.890 --> 14:15.350
Thanks for letting me win.

14:16.740 --> 14:17.340
My Lord,

14:17.820 --> 14:18.580
you said

14:18.580 --> 14:19.980
I could get a wish if I won.

14:20.580 --> 14:21.820
Will you keep your promise?

14:21.820 --> 14:22.620
Of course.

14:23.100 --> 14:24.030
What kind of wish

14:24.540 --> 14:26.420
do you want me to fulfill?

14:26.820 --> 14:27.780
Any wish is fine?

14:27.940 --> 14:28.900
Anything.

14:32.820 --> 14:33.620
I, Lu Li,

14:33.820 --> 14:34.420
want to...

14:34.420 --> 14:34.890
My Lord.

14:43.580 --> 14:44.420
My Lord,

14:44.770 --> 14:47.100
we've got the winner of the female battle.

14:47.930 --> 14:49.130
It's Junior Liu Shao.

14:51.260 --> 14:51.780
Oh.

14:52.020 --> 14:52.620
Really?

14:53.060 --> 14:53.860
Liu Shao.

14:54.260 --> 14:54.900
You won?

14:55.310 --> 14:56.060
My Lord,

14:56.700 --> 14:57.700
not only did I win,

14:58.850 --> 15:00.980
I also performed the Lightning Slash.

15:01.620 --> 15:03.020
I don't have to get smashed by you

15:03.020 --> 15:04.580
like a golden leaf.

15:04.940 --> 15:05.900
You won?

15:09.220 --> 15:09.680
Well...

15:10.410 --> 15:12.090
This year's disciples

15:12.090 --> 15:14.020
are more interesting than before.

15:15.700 --> 15:16.420
Lu Li,

15:16.980 --> 15:18.060
you just said

15:18.380 --> 15:19.860
what your wish is?

15:25.300 --> 15:25.900
I...

15:27.660 --> 15:29.420
I...I...

15:32.100 --> 15:33.960
Wang Jian and I are like brothers.

15:34.100 --> 15:37.300
Could you please make an exception and promote Wang Jian?

15:38.620 --> 15:39.300
Who?

15:39.610 --> 15:40.260
Me?

15:41.020 --> 15:41.690
Me?

15:42.020 --> 15:43.100
Come here. Hurry.

15:46.700 --> 15:47.300
Kneel.

15:47.700 --> 15:48.100
Hands.

15:48.380 --> 15:49.460
Hands.

15:51.300 --> 15:52.960
You are loyal to your friends.

15:53.500 --> 15:54.060
OK.

15:54.420 --> 15:54.900
I agree.

15:54.980 --> 15:57.240
-Thank you, My Lord. -Thank you, My Lord.

15:58.940 --> 15:59.570
Liu Shao.

15:59.820 --> 16:00.680
What about you?

16:01.020 --> 16:02.300
Do you have any wish?

16:07.700 --> 16:09.650
Please give Xue a chance.

16:09.980 --> 16:10.980
With her ability,

16:11.020 --> 16:13.750
she has surpassed many disciples in the mansion.

16:14.100 --> 16:14.890
Come here.

16:19.460 --> 16:19.940
Come on.

16:21.140 --> 16:21.740
Really?

16:23.140 --> 16:23.620
Okay.

16:23.900 --> 16:24.940
I'm happy today.

16:25.410 --> 16:26.210
All approved.

16:30.140 --> 16:32.400
-Thank you, My Lord. -Thank you, My Lord.

16:34.340 --> 16:34.980
However,

16:35.140 --> 16:36.330
Liu Shao and Lu Li,

16:36.900 --> 16:38.460
as the winners today,

16:38.580 --> 16:39.420
you two

16:40.260 --> 16:42.690
have to pass the test and training of spirit fire.

16:42.690 --> 16:43.520
Spirit fire?

16:44.180 --> 16:45.020
What is that?

17:01.530 --> 17:02.260
Brother.

17:02.260 --> 17:03.010
Your head...

17:04.380 --> 17:05.240
That's enough.

17:05.329 --> 17:05.940
All right.

17:06.380 --> 17:06.859
Let go!

17:07.010 --> 17:07.670
Let go of me!

17:12.260 --> 17:13.380
-Cheers! -Cheers.

17:17.089 --> 17:18.089
First, this drink

17:18.099 --> 17:19.339
is for Xue and me.

17:19.780 --> 17:21.540
We want to thank both of you.

17:22.500 --> 17:23.140
Second,

17:23.609 --> 17:26.180
it's for celebrating our promotion.

17:26.500 --> 17:27.170
Fattie.

17:27.740 --> 17:28.870
In order to thank us,

17:29.220 --> 17:30.750
you took out all your money.

17:31.170 --> 17:32.060
You kept saying

17:32.140 --> 17:33.740
Liu Shao loves playing and eating.

17:33.740 --> 17:35.470
Eat as much as you want tonight.

17:37.450 --> 17:39.020
You don't have to prepare the banquet.

17:38.420 --> 17:41.280
[Sword Washing Pavilion]

17:39.140 --> 17:40.340
You two work so hard.

17:40.540 --> 17:41.840
Even without our help,

17:41.860 --> 17:43.380
you'll succeed sooner or later.

17:43.380 --> 17:44.060
Well...

17:44.500 --> 17:45.630
It's still thanks to

17:45.780 --> 17:47.140
my brother's recommendation

17:47.140 --> 17:49.380
that I can stay easily.

17:51.940 --> 17:53.420
I'm more grateful to Liu Shao.

17:53.420 --> 17:54.660
Thank you for letting me know

17:54.660 --> 17:55.990
that I have my own value.

17:57.030 --> 17:57.900
Later,

17:57.900 --> 17:59.420
Lu Li and I have to attend

17:59.420 --> 18:00.460
the test and training of spirit fire.

18:00.460 --> 18:01.260
OK. Come on.

18:01.410 --> 18:02.540
Let's have another drink.

18:02.540 --> 18:03.600
-Cheers. -Cheers!

18:03.660 --> 18:04.260
Cheers!

18:04.300 --> 18:04.780
Cheers!

18:04.790 --> 18:08.660
[Sword Washing Pavilion]

18:08.660 --> 18:11.600
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

18:16.970 --> 18:17.900
Senior.

18:18.020 --> 18:19.080
How are they doing?

18:19.540 --> 18:20.300
Not bad.

18:24.740 --> 18:25.460
Dismiss.

18:27.460 --> 18:30.340
Thank you for your guidance.

18:43.020 --> 18:43.580
Senior.

18:44.580 --> 18:47.580
I didn't expect Master would let you sneak into Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

18:47.580 --> 18:49.240
You have left for three years.

18:53.340 --> 18:54.540
I'm here

18:54.740 --> 18:56.260
hoping that one day

18:56.380 --> 18:58.380
I can help you pull out the Moon Sword

18:58.780 --> 19:00.500
and find out the mystery of your background.

19:00.500 --> 19:02.360
Is this the legendary Moon Sword?

19:02.500 --> 19:02.980
Yes.

19:03.940 --> 19:04.980
For ten thousand years,

19:04.980 --> 19:06.110
the legend says that

19:06.330 --> 19:08.930
it can lead the human world to become powerful.

19:09.290 --> 19:10.580
Ten thousand years ago?

19:10.580 --> 19:11.540
That shouldn't

19:11.900 --> 19:13.580
have something to do with my background.

19:13.580 --> 19:15.640
Why must I be the one who bring it back?

19:15.980 --> 19:17.580
Marquis Wuyang really hopes

19:17.690 --> 19:18.900
someone can pull out

19:19.660 --> 19:21.380
this sword with great power.

19:40.700 --> 19:41.300
Watch out!

19:44.500 --> 19:45.300
It's useless.

19:45.900 --> 19:47.100
Only Marquis Wuyang,

19:47.220 --> 19:50.350
the lord of human world, can open this Protection Spell.

19:53.060 --> 19:53.790
It seems that

19:54.300 --> 19:55.500
it's really a long way

19:56.500 --> 19:58.230
to go to pull out the Moon Sword.

19:58.820 --> 19:59.940
Don't worry.

19:59.980 --> 20:01.860
I will help you take it away.

20:08.090 --> 20:08.740
Later,

20:08.930 --> 20:11.330
you will get the new uniform for disciples.

20:11.460 --> 20:12.660
And it's time for you and Liu Shao

20:12.660 --> 20:14.520
to go to the Forest of Spirit Fire.

20:14.580 --> 20:15.420
I heard that

20:15.780 --> 20:17.310
it is quite a strange place.

20:17.380 --> 20:18.510
You must be careful.

20:24.260 --> 20:25.020
Liu Shao.

20:26.060 --> 20:29.590
Don't think the Protection Spell here can protect you forever.

20:29.980 --> 20:30.860
I don't believe

20:31.410 --> 20:34.060
you'll hide in the Marquis Wuyang's Mansion forever

20:34.060 --> 20:35.850
and never come out.

20:35.660 --> 20:39.810
[Yu Yu Hall]

20:52.020 --> 20:53.350
What do you think? Look.

20:53.660 --> 20:54.420
Is it pretty?

20:54.940 --> 20:56.340
How is it different from before?

20:56.340 --> 20:57.340
We are going to the Forest of Spirit fire,

20:57.340 --> 20:58.300
not shopping.

20:58.420 --> 20:59.900
It's the same whatever you wear.

20:59.900 --> 21:01.500
Tell me if it's pretty first.

21:02.340 --> 21:03.620
Actually...

21:04.020 --> 21:05.450
Well...

21:12.460 --> 21:13.540
Actually,

21:15.500 --> 21:17.020
you also think it's pretty.

21:17.020 --> 21:17.540
Right?

21:22.220 --> 21:22.750
Let's go.

21:32.570 --> 21:34.700
Actually, the eye candy looks pretty.

21:35.930 --> 21:36.420
No.

21:36.770 --> 21:38.370
How could she be an eye candy?

21:39.020 --> 21:40.100
If she were an eye candy,

21:40.100 --> 21:41.660
she would not master the Lightning Slash.

21:41.660 --> 21:42.260
Ah!

21:47.460 --> 21:47.860
What?

21:48.330 --> 21:49.380
What's wrong?

21:51.900 --> 21:52.780
Xi...

22:07.500 --> 22:10.170
Ao Hen has been watching the Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

22:10.170 --> 22:11.830
Xi probably wanted to go home.

22:12.380 --> 22:13.420
As soon as she left,

22:13.420 --> 22:14.420
she got murdered.

22:14.820 --> 22:16.460
I'm going back to report to the Lord.

22:16.460 --> 22:17.180
Be careful.

22:17.180 --> 22:17.860
Okay.

22:30.660 --> 22:32.060
Although Xi went too far,

22:32.580 --> 22:34.040
she didn't deserve to die.

22:35.260 --> 22:36.980
Ao Hen causes chaos in the human world.

22:36.980 --> 22:37.860
Is there anyone

22:39.060 --> 22:40.330
that can control her?

22:41.020 --> 22:41.780
It's fine.

22:42.140 --> 22:43.070
If we train hard,

22:43.860 --> 22:45.590
we can beat her sooner or later.

22:46.420 --> 22:47.660
When I think of Ao Hen,

22:48.460 --> 22:49.820
my hands will sweat.

22:56.020 --> 22:57.020
Give me your hand.

22:59.780 --> 23:00.420
Trust me.

23:03.740 --> 23:04.460
I'm here.

23:17.140 --> 23:17.500
Look.

23:18.450 --> 23:19.740
I'm in your hands now.

23:20.820 --> 23:22.580
I won't let anything happen to you.

23:22.580 --> 23:23.640
I will protect you.

23:24.180 --> 23:25.240
Do you understand?

23:27.690 --> 23:28.180
Yes.

23:28.780 --> 23:29.310
Let's go.

23:37.890 --> 23:40.750
[Forest of Spirit Fire]

23:41.900 --> 23:42.380
My Lord.

23:43.060 --> 23:44.660
They have entered the Forest of Spirit Fire.

23:44.660 --> 23:45.420
I wonder if they

23:45.420 --> 23:47.540
can bring me a surprise.

23:55.140 --> 23:55.650
What?

23:56.490 --> 23:57.180
This...

23:57.220 --> 23:58.780
Is this the spirit fire?

23:59.450 --> 24:00.650
Are you stupid?

24:01.020 --> 24:03.140
These are just shadows of the spirit fire.

24:03.140 --> 24:03.980
How could you see

24:03.980 --> 24:05.710
the real spirit fire so easily?

24:05.730 --> 24:06.990
Then how can we find it?

24:07.100 --> 24:07.780
Watch out.

24:08.220 --> 24:09.280
I've asked around.

24:09.290 --> 24:11.780
Every time Marquis Wuyang's Mansion recruits new disciples,

24:11.780 --> 24:13.510
they would arrange the best two

24:13.540 --> 24:14.800
to get the spirit fire.

24:15.170 --> 24:16.500
But after thousands of years,

24:16.500 --> 24:17.580
no one can succeed.

24:18.900 --> 24:21.300
The reason why the spirit fire is hard to get

24:21.460 --> 24:22.900
is that it is a flame

24:22.980 --> 24:24.510
left by the Sun Supreme God.

24:24.540 --> 24:26.140
So it has the power of the sun.

24:27.220 --> 24:28.300
The spirit fire

24:28.500 --> 24:30.460
is one of the rare remains of Supreme Gods

24:30.460 --> 24:32.580
in the Three Realms.

24:33.820 --> 24:35.020
No one succeeded?

24:35.340 --> 24:37.500
Is it because they couldn't find the spirit fire

24:37.500 --> 24:39.560
or because they couldn't take it out?

24:41.860 --> 24:43.130
It is said that the spirit fire

24:43.130 --> 24:45.060
can devour people's memories.

24:45.820 --> 24:47.950
Even if they have seen the spirit fire,

24:48.020 --> 24:49.420
no one would remember it,

24:49.850 --> 24:52.540
let alone successfully take the spirit fire out.

24:52.540 --> 24:53.870
We can only try our best.

24:55.020 --> 24:55.550
Let's go.

24:58.050 --> 24:59.090
Don't walk so fast.

24:59.090 --> 25:00.380
For thousands of years,

25:00.380 --> 25:03.660
-the spirit fire enhances itself by devouring memories. -Follow up. Come on.

25:03.660 --> 25:06.720
The Forest of Spirit Fire is therefore filled with fog.

25:06.820 --> 25:07.950
I’m concerning that

25:07.980 --> 25:08.860
if this goes on,

25:09.260 --> 25:11.590
the whole forest will be swallowed by fog.

25:41.700 --> 25:42.940
It's all an illusion.

25:43.660 --> 25:44.420
What?

25:45.500 --> 25:47.060
Are you leaving?

25:48.020 --> 25:48.700
Yes.

25:49.370 --> 25:51.340
I said there are only three days.

25:58.500 --> 25:59.860
You give me the future.

26:01.740 --> 26:03.670
I give you three days of happiness.

26:04.500 --> 26:05.220
Liu Shao,

26:06.460 --> 26:07.620
this is your choice.

26:09.620 --> 26:10.880
Ten years have passed.

26:11.900 --> 26:13.220
The fate has changed.

26:14.380 --> 26:15.570
Do you regret it?

26:18.540 --> 26:19.540
Regret?

26:20.940 --> 26:21.860
I don't regret it.

26:21.860 --> 26:23.660
I won't regret for my choice.

26:28.460 --> 26:29.260
Liu Shao.

26:29.380 --> 26:30.690
Wake up.

26:30.900 --> 26:31.900
Who is speaking?

26:32.340 --> 26:33.850
Liu Shao, wake up.

26:34.860 --> 26:35.700
Liu Shao.

26:44.300 --> 26:45.760
It's just a chirp of birds.

26:45.780 --> 26:46.980
Why are you so scared?

26:50.140 --> 26:51.340
But feathers in this color

26:51.340 --> 26:52.460
are rare.

26:55.100 --> 26:57.380
I think I was draged into a dream just now.

26:58.300 --> 26:59.140
It must be it.

26:59.220 --> 27:00.180
It woke me up.

27:00.740 --> 27:01.420
What dream?

27:02.210 --> 27:03.780
You just fell.

27:06.500 --> 27:07.700
What happened?

27:11.660 --> 27:12.700
In other words,

27:12.700 --> 27:14.030
you've entered the fog.

27:14.610 --> 27:17.140
Then it make sense why nothing happened to me.

27:18.420 --> 27:19.540
Because I've been

27:20.050 --> 27:21.180
looking for my past.

27:22.220 --> 27:25.550
I don't have memory about things before my master took me in.

27:26.220 --> 27:28.100
That's why I said the illusions here

27:28.100 --> 27:29.100
are useless to me.

27:30.780 --> 27:31.780
That's right.

27:31.900 --> 27:34.660
It's not necessarily a bad thing to forget things.

27:34.660 --> 27:36.860
The feather is beautiful.

27:37.420 --> 27:38.260
In my whole life,

27:38.260 --> 27:39.140
I've never seen

27:39.140 --> 27:40.380
such a feather.

27:43.860 --> 27:44.660
You're right.

27:45.620 --> 27:47.020
I have to thank this bird.

27:47.100 --> 27:49.030
Otherwise, if you forget about me,

27:49.140 --> 27:50.000
I'll lose a lot.

27:51.220 --> 27:52.020
That's right.

27:52.300 --> 27:53.460
And that bird

27:53.460 --> 27:55.370
is like the color of the sun.

27:56.020 --> 27:56.780
Also,

27:56.780 --> 27:58.380
that bird has three feet.

27:58.380 --> 27:59.900
Isn't it amazing?

28:04.580 --> 28:05.340
The sun?

28:05.660 --> 28:06.460
What's wrong?

28:06.580 --> 28:07.860
It’s said that the body of the Sun Supreme God

28:07.860 --> 28:08.940
is a three-legged golden crow.

28:08.940 --> 28:09.700
And the sun

28:10.340 --> 28:13.300
is also transformed from the three-legged golden crow.

28:13.300 --> 28:14.740
In that case,

28:15.630 --> 28:16.490
this bird is...

28:17.660 --> 28:18.390
Spirit fire!

28:18.620 --> 28:19.280
Go after it!

28:22.020 --> 28:24.780
They disappeared in the fog for two hours.

28:25.020 --> 28:27.750
Looks like they're going to return in vain again.

28:28.500 --> 28:29.060
Chong,

28:30.020 --> 28:31.500
you were kicked out

28:31.580 --> 28:34.140
after staying in the fog for merely half an hour.

28:34.140 --> 28:36.420
But they can stay in there for so long.

28:37.340 --> 28:38.300
I think

28:38.700 --> 28:40.330
they might succeed.

29:00.060 --> 29:00.740
Hush.

29:03.140 --> 29:03.940
You're right.

29:04.050 --> 29:05.980
That bird is really three-legged.

29:07.260 --> 29:07.900
I know.

29:09.060 --> 29:09.590
Liu Shao.

29:11.010 --> 29:11.700
Go catch it.

29:12.180 --> 29:12.740
Me?

29:14.780 --> 29:16.500
The Sun Supreme God is a woman.

29:16.740 --> 29:18.860
She doesn't like men getting close to her.

29:18.860 --> 29:19.660
You should go.

29:20.180 --> 29:23.300
She is ambitious. I like her.

29:24.540 --> 29:25.400
Let me show you.

29:33.050 --> 29:34.100
Wu.

29:34.980 --> 29:36.740
Look, it’s wet and dark here.

29:36.940 --> 29:38.940
I'm sure you can't eat or sleep well.

29:39.700 --> 29:40.560
How about this?

29:40.820 --> 29:42.020
Go back with me.

29:42.460 --> 29:43.380
My family owns

29:43.700 --> 29:45.500
plenty of fields.

29:46.220 --> 29:48.220
Let me take you to enjoy great meals.

29:48.380 --> 29:48.910
Besides,

29:49.260 --> 29:52.660
I can build a pure gold nest for you.

29:53.540 --> 29:54.540
What do you think?

29:55.180 --> 29:56.380
Are you coming or not?

30:22.650 --> 30:23.660
They did it.

30:43.380 --> 30:44.020
Look.

30:44.660 --> 30:46.260
I caught her so easily.

30:46.900 --> 30:49.620
I must be really lucky today.

30:56.380 --> 30:56.700
Hot!

31:03.780 --> 31:04.500
They got it.

31:05.580 --> 31:06.110
Let's go.

31:06.900 --> 31:08.300
Come with me to help them.

31:09.820 --> 31:10.820
You two stay here.

31:23.940 --> 31:25.380
Liu Shao! Are you crazy?

31:26.090 --> 31:27.700
It's so hot. Don't you know to let go?

31:27.700 --> 31:29.900
Do you expect me to buy medicine for you?

31:32.260 --> 31:33.180
Lu Li.

31:33.820 --> 31:34.900
I found a secret.

31:37.500 --> 31:38.230
What secret?

31:39.860 --> 31:41.520
The more fiercely you treat me

31:41.940 --> 31:42.740
means

31:44.140 --> 31:44.980
the more

31:45.620 --> 31:47.080
you care about me in heart.

31:48.420 --> 31:49.580
Let me tell you.

31:50.340 --> 31:51.500
I don't sell myself.

31:51.930 --> 31:53.390
Don't try to cling onto me.

31:54.980 --> 31:57.710
Isn't it hot with your hands holding it like this?

31:58.540 --> 31:59.180
No.

31:59.900 --> 32:00.960
How could it be hot?

32:01.500 --> 32:02.980
I can block it with my vitality.

32:02.980 --> 32:04.660
I can separate from its temperature.

32:04.660 --> 32:07.260
But this is the spirit fire of the Sun Supreme God.

32:07.260 --> 32:09.100
How can it be easily controlled?

32:11.500 --> 32:13.460
You can get the golden crow easily.

32:13.460 --> 32:14.180
Why can't I

32:14.460 --> 32:15.340
control it?

32:16.090 --> 32:16.980
Go out now.

32:17.020 --> 32:17.820
Stop talking.

32:18.060 --> 32:19.340
I don't want something else happens.

32:19.340 --> 32:20.290
Get out.

32:20.540 --> 32:21.070
Hurry up.

32:22.740 --> 32:23.620
Take it.

32:24.500 --> 32:25.230
Take it well.

32:36.820 --> 32:38.420
Lu Li got the spirit fire.

32:39.100 --> 32:41.700
I'm afraid the successor of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

32:41.700 --> 32:42.940
will be him.

32:46.180 --> 32:47.180
Senior Du,

32:47.460 --> 32:50.220
those people are merely juniors who just entered the mansion.

32:50.220 --> 32:51.350
They are just lucky.

32:51.700 --> 32:53.700
How can they compare with Senior Du?

32:53.740 --> 32:54.620
In my heart,

32:55.060 --> 32:56.700
Senior Du is the best.

33:30.620 --> 33:31.420
What’s wrong?

33:31.500 --> 33:33.160
Why are you walking so slowly?

33:35.780 --> 33:36.220
I...

33:36.700 --> 33:38.540
I'm protecting you behind.

33:41.060 --> 33:41.660
Come here.

33:45.780 --> 33:46.460
What?

33:46.820 --> 33:47.820
Show me your hand.

33:49.020 --> 33:49.540
My hand?

33:50.860 --> 33:52.020
What's there to see?

34:02.410 --> 34:04.140
Look how badly you're injured.

34:06.700 --> 34:07.260
Miss Liu.

34:07.580 --> 34:08.540
Can you stop delaying?

34:08.540 --> 34:09.739
I'm almost roasted pork trotters.

34:09.739 --> 34:10.260
Can you hurry up?

34:10.260 --> 34:10.920
Demon fire!

34:31.100 --> 34:31.780
Watch out!

34:40.500 --> 34:41.340
Lu Li!

34:45.380 --> 34:45.860
Lu Li!

34:55.739 --> 34:56.199
My Lord.

34:56.340 --> 34:57.600
What happened to Lu Li?

35:02.140 --> 35:02.940
His meridian was burned

35:02.940 --> 35:04.000
by the spirit fire.

35:04.860 --> 35:06.990
I’m afraid his injury is troublesome.

35:07.140 --> 35:08.940
How did the spirit fire hurt him?

35:09.410 --> 35:11.470
I insisted on taking his spirit fire.

35:12.180 --> 35:14.040
I thought I could reduce his burn.

35:14.220 --> 35:15.060
But unexpectedly,

35:15.060 --> 35:16.220
the moment I touched his hand,

35:16.220 --> 35:17.680
the spirit fire exploded.

35:19.380 --> 35:20.380
It’s all my fault.

35:20.570 --> 35:21.570
It's all my fault.

35:31.180 --> 35:32.460
Show me your hand.

35:42.060 --> 35:43.890
Her  spiritual power is so strange.

35:43.890 --> 35:46.020
It's against Lu Li's  spiritual power.

35:46.610 --> 35:48.670
No wonder there was such an accident.

35:50.780 --> 35:51.710
Although you two

35:52.420 --> 35:54.340
successfully get the spirit fire,

35:54.340 --> 35:56.070
Lu Li's injury is quite tricky.

35:56.740 --> 35:57.870
If I want to cure him,

35:58.220 --> 36:00.750
I'm afraid it will consume 80% of my vitality.

36:00.820 --> 36:02.480
Now there are endless demons.

36:02.500 --> 36:05.160
If the news of losing 80% of my vitality gets out,

36:05.530 --> 36:06.180
I'm afraid

36:07.020 --> 36:08.660
the human world will be doomed.

36:08.660 --> 36:09.860
Then how to save Lu Li?

36:11.060 --> 36:12.720
If she can get the spirit fire,

36:12.940 --> 36:15.000
she might be able to get the King Herb.

36:16.650 --> 36:17.250
It's fine.

36:18.180 --> 36:18.970
It's not difficult for me

36:18.970 --> 36:20.630
to cure him with the King Herb.

36:21.500 --> 36:22.300
It's my fault.

36:22.660 --> 36:24.520
Let me help you find the King Herb.

36:25.220 --> 36:26.180
He did this

36:26.420 --> 36:28.500
because he was afraid that I would get hurt.

36:28.500 --> 36:29.660
No matter how hard it is,

36:29.660 --> 36:30.740
I will find the King Herb

36:30.740 --> 36:32.940
so that your vitality won't be damaged.

36:37.620 --> 36:38.620
Why don't you ask

36:39.130 --> 36:40.170
where

36:40.460 --> 36:41.920
and how to get the King Herb

36:42.290 --> 36:43.420
and is it dangerous?

36:43.420 --> 36:44.820
As long as you can save Lu Li,

36:44.820 --> 36:46.180
I'm not afraid of danger.

36:46.180 --> 36:46.900
But...

36:47.020 --> 36:49.350
Could you please not tell Lu Li about this?

36:49.500 --> 36:50.630
He's badly injured.

36:50.890 --> 36:53.020
I can't let him worry about me anymore.

36:55.910 --> 36:59.440
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

37:04.570 --> 37:05.260
Lu Li.

37:06.900 --> 37:08.420
Get well soon.

37:09.980 --> 37:11.460
You used to protect me.

37:12.660 --> 37:13.340
Now,

37:14.140 --> 37:15.670
it's my turn to protect you.

37:16.780 --> 37:18.380
Even if I have to risk my life,

37:18.900 --> 37:20.830
I'll get the King Herb back for you.

37:27.740 --> 37:30.070
The demon hunting trial is about to begin.

37:30.780 --> 37:31.910
During this period,

37:32.380 --> 37:34.310
disciples can go in and out freely.

37:35.900 --> 37:37.700
You can go to the Moon Washing Pond

37:37.700 --> 37:39.700
to figure out the ways in this period

37:40.660 --> 37:43.190
so as to find the King Herb as soon as possible.

38:00.420 --> 38:01.150
Who's there?

38:06.620 --> 38:07.700
Don't be afraid.

38:08.780 --> 38:09.540
Although

38:09.980 --> 38:11.370
I came here alone,

38:11.700 --> 38:13.220
but the Lord has ordered the seniors

38:13.220 --> 38:14.140
to clean the area.

38:14.140 --> 38:15.400
It won't be dangerous.

38:15.820 --> 38:16.180
Yes.

38:21.180 --> 38:22.660
How to open the door

38:23.060 --> 38:24.460
of the Moon Washing pond?

38:25.900 --> 38:27.180
When you go to the entrance,

38:27.180 --> 38:28.460
read the dirge.

38:28.780 --> 38:31.180
Then there will be a way to the Moon Washing Pond.

38:31.180 --> 38:32.740
The area with lanterns writen with "wu" hung over

38:32.740 --> 38:33.900
is the safe zone.

38:34.380 --> 38:36.040
The demons dare not come near.

38:39.530 --> 38:42.020
The moon is bright.

38:43.060 --> 38:45.500
The day is auspicious.

38:46.540 --> 38:48.770
The water is waving.

38:49.580 --> 38:52.060
The sun is shining.

38:52.580 --> 38:55.140
May the four seas be safe.

38:57.540 --> 38:58.020
Open!

39:05.580 --> 39:06.100
Open...

39:28.540 --> 39:29.140
Liu Shao.

39:30.840 --> 39:31.530
Liu Shao.

39:35.180 --> 39:35.830
Liu Shao.

39:37.140 --> 39:40.200
I hope that Liu Shao can get the King Herb successfully.

39:40.500 --> 39:42.460
This is not only about my life,

39:43.500 --> 39:44.580
but also

39:44.850 --> 39:46.510
the future of the human world.

39:50.880 --> 39:55.290
[Wu]

40:06.040 --> 40:09.230
[Moon Washing Pond]

40:10.290 --> 40:11.260
Wow.

40:11.380 --> 40:12.910
This place is so beautiful.

40:13.580 --> 40:15.380
I must bring Lu Li here next time.

40:17.260 --> 40:19.100
I should find the Moon Washing Stone first.

40:19.100 --> 40:19.500
Right.

40:45.690 --> 40:49.550
[Demon King in White He Na]

40:49.300 --> 40:51.430
She's from Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

40:54.100 --> 40:55.500
Demon-driving Lantern?

40:55.820 --> 40:57.420
Don't create more troubles.

40:57.420 --> 40:58.610
Have a good sleep.

41:14.500 --> 41:17.420
Who's playing the flute in the middle of the night?

41:21.660 --> 41:23.790
How can she be not affected by my flute?

41:24.700 --> 41:25.540
Is she...

41:26.620 --> 41:29.060
I'm sure it came from around here.

41:31.020 --> 41:31.750
Who's there?

41:35.980 --> 41:37.440
Are you playing the flute?

41:37.460 --> 41:39.140
I know you are a fish demon.

41:39.540 --> 41:40.470
But don't worry.

41:40.740 --> 41:42.730
Let me take you back to recuperate.

41:42.930 --> 41:43.980
When you recover,

41:44.260 --> 41:45.340
help me

41:45.540 --> 41:46.620
find the King Herb.

41:50.180 --> 41:50.740
Collect.

41:53.620 --> 41:55.970
You may just rest here.

42:12.540 --> 42:13.300
Sir Moss,

42:13.900 --> 42:15.420
you are the elderly of the Demons.

42:15.420 --> 42:16.750
You are knowledgeable.

42:17.220 --> 42:18.620
Do you know

42:17.710 --> 42:20.480
[Demonic Realm Sal Tree]

42:18.620 --> 42:21.150
who can not be controlled by the Melody Flute?

42:21.740 --> 42:22.580
Your Majesty,

42:23.260 --> 42:25.540
the Melody Flute can disrupt people's mind

42:25.540 --> 42:27.180
and bewitch people.

42:26.910 --> 42:28.960
[Elder of the Aquatic Demons Sir Moss]

42:27.580 --> 42:29.580
Person who will not be controlled,

42:29.580 --> 42:32.220
other than the two Supreme Gods who have disappeared,

42:32.220 --> 42:34.380
can only be Immortal Ze Shui

42:34.380 --> 42:36.180
who has a deep grudge against us.

42:38.820 --> 42:40.460
Your Majesty, do you want...

42:41.260 --> 42:43.140
There is a woman in the mortal world

42:43.140 --> 42:45.200
who is not afraid of the Melody Flute.

42:48.740 --> 42:50.500
It must be her,

42:50.980 --> 42:52.580
the heir of Immortal Ze Shui.

42:53.260 --> 42:55.660
I've transformed a substitute on her.

42:56.340 --> 42:58.740
Sir Moss, I hope I can find the answer this time.
